*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*& FORM DRUM_CBM_DONE
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*& ZGTED_GET_DRUM_CBM aRFC 종료 시 결과 수신 (ZGTMM_SELECT_SO_BRGEW 에서 사용)
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
FORM DRUM_CBM_DONE USING P_TASK TYPE CLIKE.

  DATA LT_CBM TYPE TABLE OF ZGTEDSIF0037.

  RECEIVE RESULTS FROM FUNCTION 'ZGTED_GET_DRUM_CBM'
    TABLES
      OT_OUTPUT = LT_CBM
    EXCEPTIONS
      COMMUNICATION_FAILURE = 1
      SYSTEM_FAILURE        = 2
      OTHERS                = 3.
  DATA(LV_SUBRC) = SY-SUBRC.

  GV_DRUM_RCV = GV_DRUM_RCV + 1.

  ASSIGN GT_DRUM_RES[ TASK = P_TASK ] TO FIELD-SYMBOL(<LS_RES>).
  CHECK SY-SUBRC EQ 0 AND LV_SUBRC EQ 0.   "실패 건은 호출부에서 순차 호출로 대체

  <LS_RES>-OK    = ABAP_TRUE.
  <LS_RES>-FOUND = COND #( WHEN LT_CBM IS NOT INITIAL THEN ABAP_TRUE ).
  <LS_RES>-CBM   = VALUE #( LT_CBM[ 1 ] OPTIONAL ).

ENDFORM.
